# dokploy_user_permissions (Resource)

Manages permissions for a Dokploy user. This resource allows you to declaratively define what projects, environments, and services a user can access, as well as their ability to create, delete, and manage infrastructure.

~> **Note:** Users must already exist in Dokploy before permissions can be assigned. Users are typically created through the Dokploy UI invitation flow.

