## Import

User permissions can be imported using the user ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_user_permissions.example user-abc123
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_user_permissions.example
  id = "user-abc123"
}
```

## Behavior on Destroy

When this resource is destroyed, all permissions for the user are reset to their default (denied) state. The user account itself is not deleted.
